  "title": "Pulte Homes Announces Grand Opening of West Village of Brighton",
  "summary": "Pulte Homes is once again growing in Metro Detroit with the grand opening of West Village of Brighton, a new community offering a variety of townhomes just two blocks west of downtown Brighton. The community offers a unique opportunity for homebuyers seeking a lively, low-maintenance lifestyle with new floor plans to the market.“We are excited...",
